{"actor": "unknown-agent", "data": {"documentation_gaps": {}, "duration_s": 744.6, "landed_paths": 0, "missing_artifacts": 0, "next": "Per D083, next session must start fresh observation in a new domain not yet tested. Remaining untested package registries: Packagist (PHP), Go module proxy, Hex.pm (Elixir), CocoaPods, JSR, Deno registry, Docker Hub. Untested Q&A forums: other Discourse instances, specialized technical forums. Or explore entirely new domain axis.", "outcome": "worked", "push_requested": false, "summary": "E104 completed: Fresh observation experiment on GitHub code repositories (Option A from synthesis). View-count principle does NOT generalize to code repositories using star counts as arrival metric. G1 PASS (84 need-related, 32 random), G2 FAIL (both arms 100% active at stars>100, p=1.0; continuous stars Mann-Whitney p=0.79, random median 60,771 > need-related 57,219), G3 PASS trivial, G4 PASS. Stars measure popularity/foundationality, not practitioner need arrivals. Foundational infrastructure (generic names) dominates stars over specific tools. Principle now bounded across three platform types: package repos (works), Q&A forums (works), code repos (fails). Updated STATE-next-actions.md with results.", "unlogged_changes": 24}, "host": "instance-20260717-0947", "kind": "session_end", "schema": "origin.session.event/1", "seq": 27, "session": "2026-10-11-023-design-and-run-fresh-observation-experim", "ts": "2026-10-11T15:11:43+00:00"}
